WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.254
This is iSpry.

2
00:00:01.304 --> 00:00:04.593
Physician-led telehealth for adults in Tennessee.

3
00:00:04.643 --> 00:00:05.479
Talk or type.

4
00:00:05.529 --> 00:00:07.319
Spry takes a short history.

5
00:00:07.369 --> 00:00:08.682
A physician decides.

6
00:00:08.732 --> 00:00:09.772
No waiting room.

7
00:00:10.062 --> 00:00:11.747
Create a free account first.

8
00:00:11.797 --> 00:00:13.482
Name, email, and a password.

9
00:00:13.532 --> 00:00:16.271
Your age, sex, and that you are in Tennessee.

10
00:00:16.321 --> 00:00:17.200
Not membership.

11
00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:17.820
No charge.

12
00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:20.771
A bot check can run invisibly while you sign up.

13
00:00:20.821 --> 00:00:22.070
You never see a puzzle.

14
00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.991
It only confirms a person is here.

15
00:00:24.281 --> 00:00:25.744
Then say what is going on.

16
00:00:25.794 --> 00:00:27.316
A sore throat, for example.

17
00:00:27.366 --> 00:00:29.993
Leave your name and birthdate out of the chat.

18
00:00:30.043 --> 00:00:34.300
Spry asks a few questions, like a triage nurse, and you can tap an answer.

19
00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:37.279
Spry has a daily limit, so it stays available.

20
00:00:37.329 --> 00:00:39.422
If you reach it, the site tells you.

21
00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:41.089
An emergency is not a queue.

22
00:00:41.379 --> 00:00:44.063
Spry then writes a plain-language synopsis.

23
00:00:44.113 --> 00:00:48.386
The most likely problem, and other possibilities for your physician.

24
00:00:48.436 --> 00:00:49.403
Not a diagnosis.

25
00:00:49.453 --> 00:00:50.929
Spry does not prescribe.

26
00:00:51.219 --> 00:00:54.305
That synopsis is filed to your chart for Doctor Merrick.

27
00:00:54.355 --> 00:00:58.337
Your name and birthdate are added then, for the record, not in the chat.

28
00:00:58.627 --> 00:01:01.432
Forty-nine dollars for one visit and one problem.

29
00:01:01.482 --> 00:01:05.802
Or one hundred dollars a month, up to three visits and three problems each.

30
00:01:05.852 --> 00:01:08.540
Stripe charges you, and never sees the symptom.

31
00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:13.090
Submit by six PM Central, and Doctor Merrick reviews it the same day.

32
00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:14.839
After six, the next morning.

33
00:01:15.129 --> 00:01:17.499
Add your address and preferred pharmacy.

34
00:01:17.549 --> 00:01:22.581
A prescription is sent only if your physician writes one, and the pharmacy bills it.

35
00:01:22.631 --> 00:01:23.912
Nothing is guaranteed.

36
00:01:23.962 --> 00:01:25.425
No controlled substances.

37
00:01:25.715 --> 00:01:27.158
Start with Ask Spry.

38
00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:29.249
In an emergency, call 9 1 1.
